{"4734250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Enduro Unleashed", "steam_appid": 4734250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enduro Unleashed is a dynamic motocross game that's all about speed, control, and courage. Hop on your dirt bike or ATV and take on expansive, off-road maps filled with steep climbs, descents, forest sections, jumps, and spots perfect for spectacular tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can ride freely, race against the clock, or create your own maps in builder mode. Place ramps, objects, and starting points, shape your own routes, save your designs, and share them with other players. Each map can become a new training ground, a race, or even a spectacular trailer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game for those who simply want to have fun off-roading: explore, break records, test new lines, and create their own motocross worlds.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enduro Unleashed is a dynamic motocross game that's all about speed, control, and courage. Hop on your dirt bike or ATV and take on expansive, off-road maps filled with steep climbs, descents, forest sections, jumps, and spots perfect for spectacular tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can ride freely, race against the clock, or create your own maps in builder mode. Place ramps, objects, and starting points, shape your own routes, save your designs, and share them with other players. Each map can become a new training ground, a race, or even a spectacular trailer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game for those who simply want to have fun off-roading: explore, break records, test new lines, and create their own motocross worlds.</p>", "short_description": "Jump on your motocross bike or quad and go wild on vast maps full of climbs, descents, jumps and tracks created by the community.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*